{"task_id": "django_004", "benchmark": "swe_qa", "condition": "graphify", "repo": "django/django", "question_type": "django", "resolved": null, "answer": "`DetailViewTest` uses a contract-style test matrix: it exercises the same `AuthorDetail` view through several interchangeable lookup strategies, then repeats the same presentation-layer assertions.\n\nIn [test_detail.py](C:/Users/ragha/Desktop/bakeoff/lb-graphify-django-django/tests/generic_views/test_detail.py:43), lookup occurs through:\n\n- Standard and custom PK arguments\n- Standard and custom slug arguments\n- PK with an ignored slug\n- Combined PK-and-slug validation\n\nRegardless of lookup strategy, each successful test asserts the same contract:\n\n- `context[\"object\"]` contains the resolved instance.\n- The model-derived `context[\"author\"]` contains that instance.\n- `generic_views/author_detail.html` is selected.\n\nThe routes in [urls.py](C:/Users/ragha/Desktop/bakeoff/lb-graphify-django-django/tests/generic_views/urls.py:41) vary lookup configuration through `pk_url_kwarg`, `slug_url_kwarg`, and `query_pk_and_slug`, while continuing to instantiate the same `AuthorDetail` class from [views.py](C:/Users/ragha/Desktop/bakeoff/lb-graphify-django-django/tests/generic_views/views.py:31).\n\nSeparate tests then vary only presentation policies\u2014`template_name`, `template_name_suffix`, `template_name_field`, and `context_object_name`\u2014and verify their outputs independently. The deferred-queryset tests further confirm that context and template derivation depend on model metadata, not on eagerly loaded fields.\n\nArchitecturally, this is separation-of-concerns verified through invariant/contract testing: object retrieval is treated as a replaceable strategy, while context naming and template resolution are orthogonal policies whose behavior must remain invariant across those strategies.", "judge_scores": {"correctness": 9, "completeness": 8, "relevance": 9, "clarity": 9, "reasoning": 9}, "input_tokens": 21220, "output_tokens": 942, "total_tokens": 22162, "cache_read_tokens": 97536, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "num_tool_calls": 5, "num_turns": 1, "task_subagent_calls": 0, "files_explored": ["tests/generic_views/test_detail.py"], "files_edited": [], "repowise_tools_called": [], "server_tools_called": {}, "attach_guard_fired": null, "token_source": "codex:turn.completed.usage", "category": "", "arm": "graphify", "arm_provenance": {"arm": "graphify", "server_name": "graphify", "launch_command": "C:\\Users\\ragha\\.local\\bin/graphify-mcp.exe", "launch_args": ["--transport", "stdio", "--graph", "C:\\Users\\ragha\\Desktop\\bakeoff\\lb-graphify-django-django/graphify-out/graph.json"], "served_tools": null, "client_tools": ["mcp__graphify__query_graph", "mcp__graphify__get_node", "mcp__graphify__get_neighbors", "mcp__graphify__shortest_path", "mcp__graphify__get_community", "mcp__graphify__god_nodes", "mcp__graphify__graph_stats"], "index": {"command": ["C:\\Users\\ragha\\.local\\bin/graphify.exe", "update", "C:\\Users\\ragha\\Desktop\\bakeoff\\lb-graphify-django-django"], "timeout_seconds": 10800}, "shares_index_with": null, "hooks_declared": [], "isolation": "worktree", "tree": "C:\\Users\\ragha\\Desktop\\bakeoff\\lb-graphify-django-django"}, "served_tools": ["get_community", "get_neighbors", "get_node", "get_pr_impact", "god_nodes", "graph_stats", "list_prs", "query_graph", "shortest_path", "triage_prs"], "served_count": 10, "mcp_tools_issued": ["mcp__graphify__query_graph", "mcp__graphify__get_node"], "mcp_isError_count": 0, "arm_exercised": true, "mcp_per_server": {"graphify": {"ok": 2, "error": 0}}, "hook_events": null, "hook_injections": null, "index_evidence": {"arm": "graphify", "rc": 0, "seconds": 167.4, "argv": ["C:\\Users\\ragha\\.local\\bin/graphify.exe", "update", "C:\\Users\\ragha\\Desktop\\bakeoff\\lb-graphify-django-django"], "tree": "C:\\Users\\ragha\\Desktop\\bakeoff\\lb-graphify-django-django"}, "models_used": ["gpt-5.6-sol"], "prompt_style": "neutral", "judge_model": "claude-sonnet-5", "wall_clock_seconds": 46.88216590881348, "index_time_seconds": 0.0, "judge_time_seconds": 5.939016342163086, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.048137, "error": null, "timed_out": false, "retries": 0, "timestamp": "2026-08-05T13:55:39.012142+00:00", "prompt_sent": "Answer the following question about this code repository.\nBe specific and reference actual code files and functions.\n\nQUESTION: What architectural pattern does DetailViewTest employ to verify that context object naming and template resolution mechanisms maintain independence from the underlying object lookup strategy?\n\nThink step by step. Use the available tools to explore the codebase.", "model_used": "gpt-5.6-sol", "session_id": "", "stop_reason": "", "duration_api_ms": 46880, "repo_commit": "3b161e60964a", "raw_output_file": "logs\\layerb_codex_bakeoff_django\\raw_outputs\\django_004_graphify.json"}
{"task_id": "django_004", "benchmark": "swe_qa", "condition": "code-review-graph", "repo": "django/django", "question_type": "django", "resolved": null, "answer": "`DetailViewTest` uses a black-box, invariant-based test matrix\u2014essentially a separation-of-concerns pattern.\n\nThe same `AuthorDetail` view is exercised through interchangeable lookup strategies:\n\n- primary key\n- custom primary-key URL argument\n- slug\n- custom slug URL argument\n- combined PK and slug\n\nThese variants are configured in [urls.py](C:/Users/ragha/Desktop/bakeoff/lb-code-review-graph-django-django/tests/generic_views/urls.py:41), often through `as_view()` options such as `pk_url_kwarg`, `slug_url_kwarg`, and `query_pk_and_slug`. They all use the same queryset-only view definition in [views.py](C:/Users/ragha/Desktop/bakeoff/lb-code-review-graph-django-django/tests/generic_views/views.py:31).\n\nFor every successful lookup, methods such as `test_detail_by_pk()`, `test_detail_by_custom_pk()`, `test_detail_by_slug()`, and `test_detail_by_pk_and_slug()` repeat the same presentation-layer contract in [test_detail.py](C:/Users/ragha/Desktop/bakeoff/lb-code-review-graph-django-django/tests/generic_views/test_detail.py:38):\n\n- the generic `object` context variable contains the resolved author;\n- the model-derived `author` context variable contains that same object;\n- the inferred template remains `generic_views/author_detail.html`.\n\nSeparate tests then vary `context_object_name`, `template_name`, `template_name_suffix`, and `template_name_field` independently.\n\nThus, the architecture under test is orthogonal composition: `SingleObjectMixin`-style lookup behavior may change, while context naming and `SingleObjectTemplateResponseMixin` template inference remain stable, independently testable contracts. `test_custom_detail()` reinforces this by calling `get_context_object_name(author)` with an explicit object rather than relying on `self.object`.", "judge_scores": {"correctness": 8, "completeness": 7, "relevance": 9, "clarity": 8, "reasoning": 8}, "input_tokens": 13121, "output_tokens": 873, "total_tokens": 13994, "cache_read_tokens": 69376, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "num_tool_calls": 3, "num_turns": 1, "task_subagent_calls": 0, "files_explored": ["tests\\\\generic_views\\\\test_detail.py", "tests\\\\generic_views\\\\urls.py", "tests\\\\generic_views\\\\views.py"], "files_edited": [], "repowise_tools_called": [], "server_tools_called": {}, "attach_guard_fired": null, "token_source": "codex:turn.completed.usage", "category": "", "arm": "code-review-graph", "arm_provenance": {"arm": "code-review-graph", "server_name": "crg", "launch_command": "C:\\Users\\ragha\\.local\\bin/code-review-graph.exe", "launch_args": ["serve", "--repo", "C:\\Users\\ragha\\Desktop\\bakeoff\\lb-code-review-graph-django-django"], "served_tools": null, "client_tools": ["mcp__crg__semantic_search_nodes_tool", "mcp__crg__query_graph_tool", "mcp__crg__traverse_graph_tool", "mcp__crg__get_flow_tool", "mcp__crg__list_flows_tool", "mcp__crg__get_affected_flows_tool", "mcp__crg__get_architecture_overview_tool", "mcp__crg__get_bridge_nodes_tool", "mcp__crg__get_community_tool", "mcp__crg__list_communities_tool", "mcp__crg__get_hub_nodes_tool", "mcp__crg__get_impact_radius_tool", "mcp__crg__get_knowledge_gaps_tool", "mcp__crg__get_minimal_context_tool", "mcp__crg__get_docs_section_tool", "mcp__crg__get_wiki_page_tool", "mcp__crg__get_suggested_questions_tool", "mcp__crg__get_surprising_connections_tool", "mcp__crg__find_large_functions_tool", "mcp__crg__list_graph_stats_tool"], "index": {"command": ["C:\\Users\\ragha\\.local\\bin/code-review-graph.exe", "build", "--repo", "C:\\Users\\ragha\\Desktop\\bakeoff\\lb-code-review-graph-django-django", "--embedding-provider", "local", "--embedding-model", "sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2"], "timeout_seconds": 10800}, "shares_index_with": null, "hooks_declared": [], "isolation": "worktree", "tree": "C:\\Users\\ragha\\Desktop\\bakeoff\