{"task_id": "django_045", "benchmark": "swe_qa", "condition": "codegraph", "repo": "django/django", "question_type": "django", "resolved": null, "answer": "The mocked method is implemented directly on the base SQL `Query` class:\n\n- [`django/db/models/sql/query.py:231`](C:/Users/ragha/Desktop/bakeoff/lb-codegraph-django-django/django/db/models/sql/query.py:231): `class Query(BaseExpression)`\n- [`django/db/models/sql/query.py:1662`](C:/Users/ragha/Desktop/bakeoff/lb-codegraph-django-django/django/db/models/sql/query.py:1662): `Query.add_q(self, q_object, reuse_all=False)`\n\nIt is not an override in `DeleteQuery`, `UpdateQuery`, `InsertQuery`, or `AggregateQuery`; those subclasses inherit it from `Query`.\n\nThe deferred-filtering tests patch that base method with `mock.patch.object(Query, \"add_q\", ...)` in:\n\n- [`tests/prefetch_related/tests.py:388`](C:/Users/ragha/Desktop/bakeoff/lb-codegraph-django-django/tests/prefetch_related/tests.py:388), in `PrefetchRelatedTests.test_filter_deferred`\n- [`tests/prefetch_related/tests.py:1130`](C:/Users/ragha/Desktop/bakeoff/lb-codegraph-django-django/tests/prefetch_related/tests.py:1130), in `CustomPrefetchTests.test_filter_deferred`\n\nThus, the intercepted implementation sits at `Query` itself\u2014the common base SQL-query level\u2014not further down the query subclass hierarchy. The saved `add_q = Query.add_q` is invoked by the mock\u2019s `side_effect`, allowing the real implementation to run while its deferred invocation count is measured.", "judge_scores": {"correctness": 9, "completeness": 9, "relevance": 10, "clarity": 9, "reasoning": 9}, "input_tokens": 22844, "output_tokens": 1428, "total_tokens": 24272, "cache_read_tokens": 164864, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "num_tool_calls": 8, "num_turns": 1, "task_subagent_calls": 0, "files_explored": ["\\\\prefetch_related\\\\tests.py", "django\\\\db\\\\models\\\\query.py", "tests\\\\prefetch_related\\\\tests.py"], "files_edited": [], "repowise_tools_called": [], "server_to