{"task_id": "django_045", "benchmark": "swe_qa", "condition": "graphify", "repo": "django/django", "question_type": "django", "resolved": null, "answer": "The intercepted implementation is `Query.add_q()` itself, defined on the base `Query` class in [django/db/models/sql/query.py](C:/Users/ragha/Desktop/bakeoff/lb-graphify-django-django/django/db/models/sql/query.py:1662). The `Query` class begins at line 231.\n\nIt is not an override in one of the specialized query subclasses from `django/db/models/sql/subqueries.py`; those subclasses inherit the base implementation. Deferred filtering eventually reaches this method when the `QuerySet` applies its pending filter to its underlying `Query` object.", "judge_scores": {"correctness": 8, "completeness": 6, "relevance": 8, "clarity": 8, "reasoning": 6}, "input_tokens": 7181, "output_tokens": 739, "total_tokens": 7920, "cache_read_tokens": 39168, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "num_tool_calls": 1, "num_turns": 1, "task_subagent_calls": 0, "files_explored": [], "files_edited": [], "repowise_tools_called": [], "server_tools_called": {}, "attach_guard_fired": null, "token_source": "codex:turn.completed.usage", "category": "", "arm": "graphify", "arm_provenance": {"arm": "graphify", "server_name": "graphify", "launch_command": "C:\\Users\\ragha\\.local\\bin/graphify-mcp.exe", "launch_args": ["--transport", "stdio", "--graph", "C:\\Users\\ragha\\Desktop\\bakeoff\\lb-graphify-django-django/graphify-out/graph.json"], "served_tools": null, "client_tools": ["mcp__graphify__query_graph", "mcp__graphify__get_node", "mcp__graphify__get_neighbors", "mcp__graphify__shortest_path", "mcp__graphify__get_community", "mcp__graphify__god_nodes", "mcp__graphify__graph_stats"], "index": {"command": ["C:\\Users\\ragha\\.local\\bin/graphify.exe", "update", "C:\\Users\\ragha\\Desktop\\bakeoff\\lb-graphify-django-django"], "timeout_seconds": 10800}, "shares_index_with": null, "hooks_declared": [], "isolation": "worktree", "tree": "C:\\Users\\ragha\\Deskt